{"id": "eec74bf6-34b9-4df4-be44-313529e520ab", "slug": "package-tracking", "title": "Package Tracking", "description": "Package Tracking Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Package Tracking\"\ndescription: \"Package Tracking Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#52563F\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#52563F\"\n  background: \"#EBE8E0\"\n  surface: \"#52563F\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#52563F\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Package Tracking\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 256; favorites: 21; remixes: 0.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, support, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nPackage Tracking Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nTracking ID TRK-9284-0017 Package in transit ORDERED MAY 18 SHIPPED MAY 20 IN TRANSIT MAY 22 DELIVERED MAY 25 Get real-time updates turn on notifications New York, US May 20 Paris, FR May 22 Estimated Delivery MAY 25 by…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Package in transit.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #52563F, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #52563F, background #EBE8E0, surface #52563F, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Playfair Display for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Package Tracking</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Animation Libraries -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#ebe8e0] font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 overflow-x-hidden relative selection:bg-[#595d42] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Ambient Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Container Wrapper with Gradient Border -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1024px] rounded-[2.5rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/80 via-transparent to-black/10 shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] gs-reveal-container\">\n\n        <!-- Inner Card -->\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-transparent rounded-[2.45rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row relative shadow-inner\">\n\n            <!-- Left Pane (Light) -->\n            <section class=\"w-full lg:w-[55%] bg-[#f4f2eb] p-8 md:p-14 flex flex-col justify-between relative z-10 gs-left-pane\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <header class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-16 gs-anim-el\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#52563f] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 font-normal uppercase mb-1\">Tracking ID</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-900\">TRK-9284-0017</div>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Main Title -->\n                <h1 class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',serif] text-6xl md:text-[5rem] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-[#1a1a1a] mb-20 gs-anim-el\">\n                    Package<br>in transit\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Progress Tracker -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full mb-16 gs-anim-el px-6\">\n                    <!-- Base Track -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 right-6 h-[1px] bg-gray-300/80 -z-10\"></div>\n                    <!-- Active Track (Animated by GSAP) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 h-[1px] bg-[#52563f] -z-10 gs-progress-line\" style=\"width: 0%;\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start relative z-10 -mx-6\">\n                        <!-- Step 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 w-12 gs-step\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#52563f] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-center w-24\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">ORDERED</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">MAY 18</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Step 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 w-12 gs-step\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#52563f] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-center w-24\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">SHIPPED</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">MAY 20</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Step 3 (Current) -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 w-12 gs-step\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-[#52563f] bg-[#f4f2eb] flex items-center justify-center text-[#52563f] relative z-10\">\n                                <!-- Ping animation for active state -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-[#52563f] opacity-40 animate-[ping_3s_cubic-bezier(0,0,0.2,1)_infinite]\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bus-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-center w-24\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">IN TRANSIT</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-[#52563f] uppercase tracking-wider font-medium\">MAY 22</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Step 4 (Future) -->\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 w-12 gs-step opacity-50\">\n                            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-gray-300 bg-[#f4f2eb] flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-center w-24\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-gray-500 mb-1\">DELIVERED</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">MAY 25</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Notifications Toggle -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#e7e3d5] rounded-2xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between gs-anim-el cursor-pointer group transition-colors hover:bg-[#e0dccb]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#d7d2c3] flex items-center justify-center text-[#52563f] transition-colors group-hover:bg-[#cdcaaf]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" width=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">Get real-time updates</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-light mt-0.5\">turn on notifications</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Custom Toggle Component -->\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-7 bg-[#52563f] rounded-full relative shadow-inner overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-1 top-1 bottom-1 w-5 bg-[#f4f2eb] rounded-full shadow-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-active:scale-95 group-active:translate-x-1\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Right Pane (Dark) -->\n            <section class=\"w-full lg:w-[45%] bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white p-8 md:p-14 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden gs-right-pane lg:border-l border-white/5\">\n\n                <!-- Map Dot Pattern Overlay -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1.5px 1.5px, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 10px 10px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 80%);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Route Visualization -->\n                <div class=\"relative h-72 w-full mt-4 mb-auto gs-anim-right z-10 flex-shrink-0\">\n                    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 250\" class=\"overflow-visible absolute top-0 left-0\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n\n                        <!-- Dotted base route -->\n                        <path d=\"M 60,130 Q 200,80 340,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,4\"></path>\n\n                        <!-- Animated Progress Route -->\n                        <path id=\"active-route\" d=\"M 60,130 Q 200,80 340,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#52563f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n\n                        <!-- Start Point (New York) -->\n                        <g transform=\"translate(60,130)\" class=\"gs-map-marker\">\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" class=\"opacity-30\"></circle>\n                            <text x=\"20\" y=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"Inter\" letter-spacing=\"0.1em\" class=\"font-normal uppercase\">New York, US</text>\n                            <text x=\"20\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#888888\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"Inter\" letter-spacing=\"0.05em\" class=\"uppercase font-light\">May 20</text>\n                            <!-- Connecting line to text -->\n                            <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>\n                        </g>\n\n                        <!-- End Point (Paris) -->\n                        <g transform=\"translate(340,140)\" class=\"gs-map-marker\">\n                            <!-- Target elements -->\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#52563f\"></circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#52563f\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                            <!-- Rotating outer dash -->\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#52563f\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\" class=\"animate-[spin_12s_linear_infinite] origin-[0px_0px]\"></circle>\n\n                            <text x=\"-20\" y=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"Inter\" letter-spacing=\"0.1em\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"font-normal uppercase\">Paris, FR</text>\n                            <text x=\"-20\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#888888\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"Inter\" letter-spacing=\"0.05em\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"uppercase font-light\">May 22</text>\n                             <!-- Connecting line to text -->\n                             <line x1=\"-6\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-16\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"rgba(82,86,63,0.5)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,1\"></line>\n                        </g>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Information -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between mt-auto pt-8 gs-anim-right z-10 relative\">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400 uppercase font-normal mb-6\">Estimated Delivery</div>\n                        <div class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',serif] text-5xl md:text-[4rem] tracking-tight leading-none text-white mb-3\">MAY 25</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 font-light\">by end of day</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center h-full\">\n                        <!-- Divider -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-gray-700 to-transparent mx-6 md:mx-8\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Action Button -->\n                        <button class=\"group flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[4.5rem] h-[3.25rem] rounded-xl bg-[#52563f] flex items-center justify-center text-white mb-3 shadow-lg transition-colors relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <!-- Inline Shimmer Effect via translation -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out z-10\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"relative z-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase font-normal\">View Details</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Ambient Background Setup ---\n        // Generates an elegant, slow-moving geometric wireframe ambient effect instead of a generic gradient\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 20;\n\n            // Create a complex geometric shape for ambient structure\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(14, 2);\n\n            // Warm, subtle olive/grey tone to match UI palette\n            const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x8a8b82,\n                wireframe: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.08\n            });\n\n            const ambientMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n\n            // Offset to sit nicely behind the card\n            ambientMesh.position.x = 8;\n            ambientMesh.position.y = -4;\n            scene.add(ambientMesh);\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                // Extremely slow, elegant rotation\n                ambientMesh.rotation.x += 0.0003;\n                ambientMesh.rotation.y += 0.0005;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animation Sequence ---\n        const initAnimations = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" }\n            });\n\n            // Initial States\n            gsap.set(\".gs-reveal-container\", { y: 40, scale: 0.98, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-anim-el\", { y: 20, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-step\", { y: 15, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-anim-right\", { x: 30, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-map-marker\", { scale: 0, transformOrigin: \"center center\" });\n\n            // SVG Path Setup\n            const activeRoute = document.getElementById('active-route');\n            const routeLength = activeRoute.getTotalLength();\n            gsap.set(activeRoute, { strokeDasharray: routeLength, strokeDashoffset: routeLength });\n\n            // Master Animation Sequence\n            tl.to(\".gs-reveal-container\", {\n                y: 0,\n                scale: 1,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.4,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            })\n            // Left Pane Flow\n            .to(\".gs-anim-el\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15\n            }, \"-=1\")\n            .to(\".gs-step\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1\n            }, \"-=0.6\")\n            // Progress Line Fill (66.66% corresponds to step 3 'In Transit')\n            .to(\".gs-progress-line\", {\n                width: \"66.66%\",\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\")\n            // Right Pane Flow\n            .to(\".gs-anim-right\", {\n                x: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.2\n            }, \"-=1.2\")\n            // Map Draw Sequence\n            .to(\".gs-map-marker\", {\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.7)\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\")\n            .to(activeRoute, {\n                strokeDashoffset: 0,\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            // Slight delay to ensure paint before animation starts\n            setTimeout(initAnimations, 100);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "package-tracking.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/package-tracking.jpg", "source_name": "package-tracking-DESIGN.md", "views": 397, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:07:31.610879+00:00"}